d RDISTNN: Conditional effects and regression with DNN weights
d
d Stata companion to RdistNN: CATE, nonparametric regression, pointwise
d jackknife uncertainty, tuning grids, diagnostics, and native plots.
d Supported binary-IV CLATE retains paired frozen-score covariance and
d shares the reporting, diagnostics, and plotting interfaces.
d Experimental PLQR support evaluates moments at supplied theta; it is not a
d coefficient estimator.
